### Why this is a great change:
You've officially unified the Bulk flow and the Manual flow. Both processes now simply generate a batch in the "P" (Pending) state with no schedule attached. If the user decides to schedule it in the UI on the success screen, the /update-schedule endpoint fires and cleanly updates the master record, completely skipping the messy Redis metadata step.
